chem11AddSection("chem11-acids-bases-salts",{"id": "chem11-p246-conjugate-pairs", "title": "Conjugate pairs · Table 8.2 Some examples of Bronsted-Lowery acids and bases", "headingUrdu": "مزدوج جوڑے · جدول 8.2 برونسٹڈ لوری تیزابوں اور اساسوں کی کچھ مثالیں", "headingPashto": "مزدوج جوړې · جدول 8.2 د برونسټډ-لوري د اسیدونو او القليو ځینې بېلګې", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 246, "printedPage": 241}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p246-a1"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p246-a2"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 1}, {"type": "equation", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p246-a3"]}, {"type": "table", "index": 0}], "equations": [{"id": "chem11-p246-r", "latex": "\\underset{\\text{Base}}{\\mathrm{NH_{3(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{Acid}}{\\mathrm{H_2O_{(l)}}}\\rightleftharpoons\\underset{\\text{Conjugate Acid}}{\\mathrm{NH^+_{4(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{Conjugate Base}}{\\mathrm{OH^-_{(aq)}}}", "accessible": "NH₃(aq) (Base) + H₂O(l) (Acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (Conjugate Acid) + OH⁻(aq) (Conjugate Base)", "formatSourceNotation": true, "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Base) + H₂O(l) (Acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (Conjugate Acid) + OH⁻(aq) (Conjugate Base)"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Base) + H₂O(l) (Acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (Conjugate Acid) + OH⁻(aq) (Conjugate Base)"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Base) + H₂O(l) (Acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (Conjugate Acid) + OH⁻(aq) (Conjugate Base)"}]]}}], "figures": [{"id": "chem11-p246-pair", "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Conjugate base-acid pair and conjugate acid-base pair for HA + B⁻ ⇌ A⁻ + HB\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"Arial\">HA</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">(aq)</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"Arial\">B⁻</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">(aq)</text><path d=\"M180 38 h70 M180 46 h70\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"Arial\">A⁻</text><text x=\"297\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">(aq)</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"Arial\">HB</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\">(aq)</text><path d=\"M22 18 v-8 h360 v26 M30 56 v18 h290 v-30\" stroke=\"#a03040\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"8\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Conjugate base-acid pair</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">conjugate acid-base pair</text></svg>", "caption": "HA(aq) + B⁻(aq) ⇌ A⁻(aq) + HB(aq): two conjugate pairs", "captionUrdu": "HA(aq) + B⁻(aq) ⇌ A⁻(aq) + HB(aq): دو مزدوج جوڑے", "captionPashto": "HA(aq) + B⁻(aq) ⇌ A⁻(aq) + HB(aq): دوه مزدوج جوړې", "labels": [{"en": "Conjugate base-acid pair", "ur": "مزدوج اساس تیزاب جوڑا", "ps": "مزدوج القلي-اسید جوړه"}, {"en": "Conjugate acid-base pair", "ur": "مزدوج تیزاب اساس جوڑا", "ps": "مزدوج اسید-القلي جوړه"}], "sourceGap": {"note": "Diagram redrawn as a schematic; bracket shapes are approximate."}}, {"id": "chem11-p246-lewis", "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lewis structures for NH3 + H2O ⇌ NH4+ + OH- showing conjugate acid-base pairs\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:580px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial\">H–N̈–H + H–Ö:</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial\">H</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial\">H</text><path d=\"M260 66 h60 M260 74 h60\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M345 20 h-10 v100 h10\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial\">H–N–H</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial\">H</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial\">H</text><path d=\"M460 20 h10 v100 h-10\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><text x=\"495\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><text x=\"515\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial\">H–Ö:</text><path d=\"M20 50 v-30 h250 M520 100 h-480 v-20\" stroke=\"#c0305a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Conjugate acid-base pair</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Conjugate acid-base pair</text></svg>", "caption": "NH₃ + H₂O ⇌ NH₄⁺ + OH⁻ (Lewis structures with conjugate acid-base pairs)", "captionUrdu": "NH₃ + H₂O ⇌ NH₄⁺ + OH⁻ (مزدوج تیزاب اساس جوڑوں کے ساتھ لیوس ساختیں)", "captionPashto": "NH₃ + H₂O ⇌ NH₄⁺ + OH⁻ (د مزدوج اسید-القلي جوړو سره لیویس جوړښتونه)", "labels": [{"en": "Conjugate acid-base pair", "ur": "مزدوج تیزاب اساس جوڑا", "ps": "مزدوج اسید-القلي جوړه"}], "sourceGap": {"note": "Electron-dot Lewis structures redrawn as a schematic; lone-pair dots are not reproduced exactly."}}], "tables": [{"caption": "Table 8.2: Some examples of Bronsted-Lowery acids and bases", "captionUrdu": "جدول 8.2: برونسٹڈ لوری تیزابوں اور اساسوں کی کچھ مثالیں", "captionPashto": "جدول 8.2: د برونسټډ-لوري د اسیدونو او القليو ځینې بېلګې", "headers": [{"en": "Acid", "ur": "تیزاب", "ps": "اسید"}, {"en": "Base", "ur": "اساس", "ps": "القلي"}, {"en": "Conjugate acid", "ur": "مزدوج تیزاب", "ps": "مزدوج اسید"}, {"en": "Conjugate base", "ur": "مزدوج اساس", "ps": "مزدوج القلي"}], "rows": [[{"en": "HCO₃⁻", "ur": "HCO₃⁻", "ps": "HCO₃⁻"}, {"en": "+ H₂O", "ur": "+ H₂O", "ps": "+ H₂O"}, {"en": "H₃O⁺", "ur": "H₃O⁺", "ps": "H₃O⁺"}, {"en": "+ CO₃²⁻", "ur": "+ CO₃²⁻", "ps": "+ CO₃²⁻"}], [{"en": "CH₃COOH", "ur": "CH₃COOH", "ps": "CH₃COOH"}, {"en": "+ H₂O", "ur": "+ H₂O", "ps": "+ H₂O"}, {"en": "H₃O⁺", "ur": "H₃O⁺", "ps": "H₃O⁺"}, {"en": "+ CH₃COO⁻", "ur": "+ CH₃COO⁻", "ps": "+ CH₃COO⁻"}], [{"en": "HCN", "ur": "HCN", "ps": "HCN"}, {"en": "+ H₂O", "ur": "+ H₂O", "ps": "+ H₂O"}, {"en": "H₃O⁺", "ur": "H₃O⁺", "ps": "H₃O⁺"}, {"en": "+ CN⁻", "ur": "+ CN⁻", "ps": "+ CN⁻"}], [{"en": "H₂S", "ur": "H₂S", "ps": "H₂S"}, {"en": "+ H₂O", "ur": "+ H₂O", "ps": "+ H₂O"}, {"en": "H₃O⁺", "ur": "H₃O⁺", "ps": "H₃O⁺"}, {"en": "+ HS⁻", "ur": "+ HS⁻", "ps": "+ HS⁻"}], [{"en": "H₂O", "ur": "H₂O", "ps": "H₂O"}, {"en": "+ NH₃", "ur": "+ NH₃", "ps": "+ NH₃"}, {"en": "NH₄⁺", "ur": "NH₄⁺", "ps": "NH₄⁺"}, {"en": "+ OH⁻", "ur": "+ OH⁻", "ps": "+ OH⁻"}], [{"en": "H₂O", "ur": "H₂O", "ps": "H₂O"}, {"en": "+ CO₃²⁻", "ur": "+ CO₃²⁻", "ps": "+ CO₃²⁻"}, {"en": "HCO₃⁻", "ur": "HCO₃⁻", "ps": "HCO₃⁻"}, {"en": "+ OH⁻", "ur": "+ OH⁻", "ps": "+ OH⁻"}]], "sourceGap": {"note": "Each row is printed as Acid + Base ⇌ Conjugate acid + Conjugate base with an equilibrium arrow; the arrow column is omitted here and the \"+\" signs are shown inside the cells."}}], "sourceNote": "Printed folio 241. The first line continues from the previous page; its first letters are cut. The text is otherwise legible. The first Lewis-structure box and the labels \"Conjugate acid-base pair\" are drawn around the equation; they are redrawn as figures. A CamScanner watermark crosses the page.", "sourceGap": {"note": "First letters of the first line are cut off (reads \"…cid.\")."}, "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-12T10:08:26.369371+00:00", "scope": "Chemistry p246", "unresolved": "Edge clipping; figures redrawn; translations need native review"}, "paras": [
chem11Pair("[scan obscured]cid. Thus, in an acid base reaction, two conjugate pairs are formed.","[scan obscured]cid۔ اس طرح تیزاب اساس تعامل میں دو مزدوج جوڑے بنتے ہیں۔","[scan obscured]cid. په دې توګه د اسید-القلي په تعامل کې دوه مزدوج جوړې جوړېږي.",{"id": "chem11-p246-a1"}),
chem11Pair("A specie formed from an acid by the loss of a proton is called the conjugate base of that acid and a specie formed from a base by gaining a proton is called the conjugate acid of that base e.g. consider the following reaction.","کسی تیزاب سے پروٹان کے نکلنے سے بننے والی نوع اس تیزاب کا مزدوج اساس کہلاتی ہے اور کسی اساس میں پروٹان کے شامل ہونے سے بننے والی نوع اس اساس کا مزدوج تیزاب کہلاتی ہے، مثلاً درج ذیل تعامل پر غور کریں۔","هغه ډول چې له یو اسید څخه د پروټون د له لاسه ورکولو سره جوړېږي د هغه اسید مزدوج القلي بلل کېږي او هغه ډول چې له یو القلي سره د پروټون په ترلاسه کولو سره جوړېږي د هغه القلي مزدوج اسید بلل کېږي، د بېلګې په توګه لاندې تعامل ته پام وکړئ.",{"id": "chem11-p246-a2"}),
chem11Pair("In this case, NH₄⁺ is the conjugate acid of the base NH₃, and OH⁻ is the conjugate base of the acid H₂O. The atom in the Bronsted – Lowery base that accepts an H⁺ ion must have a lone pair.","اس صورت میں NH₄⁺ اساس NH₃ کا مزدوج تیزاب ہے اور OH⁻ تیزاب H₂O کا مزدوج اساس ہے۔ برونسٹڈ لوری اساس میں وہ ایٹم جو H⁺ آئن قبول کرتا ہے اس میں ایک تنہا جوڑا ہونا چاہیے۔","پدې حالت کې NH₄⁺ د القلي NH₃ مزدوج اسید دی او OH⁻ د اسید H₂O مزدوج القلي دی. په برونسټډ-لوري القلي کې هغه اتوم چې H⁺ آیون منل کوي باید یو ځانته جوړه ولري.",{"id": "chem11-p246-a3"})
]});
chem11WordVocabulary["lone pair"]={"ur": "تنہا جوڑا", "ps": "ځانته جوړه"};
