chem11AddSection("chem11-acids-bases-salts",{"id": "chem11-p249-ionization-water", "title": "Weak acid/strong conjugate base · 8.4.1 Ionization Equation of Water · Figure 8.2 Self-Ionization of Water", "headingUrdu": "کمزور تیزاب/مضبوط مزدوج اساس · 8.4.1 پانی کی آئنائزیشن مساوات · شکل 8.2 پانی کی خود آئنائزیشن", "headingPashto": "ضعیف اسید/قوي مزدوج القلي · 8.4.1 د اوبو د آیونایزیشن معادله · شکل 8.2 د اوبو ځان آیونایزیشن", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 249, "printedPage": 244}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p249-a1", "chem11-p249-a2", "chem11-p249-a3", "chem11-p249-a4"]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p249-a5"]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 1}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p249-h841", "chem11-p249-b1", "chem11-p249-rc-h", "chem11-p249-rc1", "chem11-p249-b2", "chem11-p249-b3", "chem11-p249-b4"]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["chem11-p249-b5"]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3}], "equations": [{"id": "chem11-p249-ac", "latex": "\\underset{\\text{weak acid}}{\\mathrm{CH_3COOH_{(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{Weak base}}{\\mathrm{H_2O_{(aq)}}}\\rightleftharpoons\\underset{\\text{strong conjugate acid}}{\\mathrm{H_3O^+_{(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{strong conjugate base}}{\\mathrm{CH_3COO^-_{(aq)}}}", "accessible": "CH₃COOH(aq) (weak acid) + H₂O(aq) (Weak base) ⇌ H₃O⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + CH₃COO⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)", "formatSourceNotation": true, "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "CH₃COOH(aq) (weak acid) + H₂O(aq) (Weak base) ⇌ H₃O⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + CH₃COO⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "CH₃COOH(aq) (weak acid) + H₂O(aq) (Weak base) ⇌ H₃O⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + CH₃COO⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "CH₃COOH(aq) (weak acid) + H₂O(aq) (Weak base) ⇌ H₃O⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + CH₃COO⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]]}}, {"id": "chem11-p249-am", "latex": "\\underset{\\text{Weak base}}{\\mathrm{NH_{3(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{Weak acid}}{\\mathrm{H_2O_{(aq)}}}\\rightleftharpoons\\underset{\\text{strong conjugate acid}}{\\mathrm{NH^+_{4(aq)}}}+\\underset{\\text{strong conjugate base}}{\\mathrm{OH^-_{(aq)}}}", "accessible": "NH₃(aq) (Weak base) + H₂O(aq) (Weak acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + OH⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)", "formatSourceNotation": true, "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Weak base) + H₂O(aq) (Weak acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + OH⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Weak base) + H₂O(aq) (Weak acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + OH⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "NH₃(aq) (Weak base) + H₂O(aq) (Weak acid) ⇌ NH₄⁺(aq) (strong conjugate acid) + OH⁻(aq) (strong conjugate base)"}]]}}, {"id": "chem11-p249-w1", "latex": "\\underset{\\text{Acid1}}{\\mathrm{H_2O}}+\\underset{\\text{Base1}}{\\mathrm{H_2O}}\\rightleftharpoons\\underset{\\text{Acid2}}{\\mathrm{H_3O^+}}+\\underset{\\text{Base2}}{\\mathrm{OH^-}}", "accessible": "H₂O (Acid1) + H₂O (Base1) ⇌ H₃O⁺ (Acid2) + OH⁻ (Base2)", "formatSourceNotation": true, "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "H₂O (Acid1) + H₂O (Base1) ⇌ H₃O⁺ (Acid2) + OH⁻ (Base2)"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "H₂O (Acid1) + H₂O (Base1) ⇌ H₃O⁺ (Acid2) + OH⁻ (Base2)"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "H₂O (Acid1) + H₂O (Base1) ⇌ H₃O⁺ (Acid2) + OH⁻ (Base2)"}]]}}, {"id": "chem11-p249-w2", "latex": "\\mathrm{H_2O\\rightleftharpoons H^++OH^-}", "accessible": "H₂O ⇌ H⁺ + OH⁻", "formatSourceNotation": true, "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "H₂O ⇌ H⁺ + OH⁻"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "H₂O ⇌ H⁺ + OH⁻"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "H₂O ⇌ H⁺ + OH⁻"}]]}}], "figures": [{"id": "chem11-p249-fig8-2", "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two water molecules reacting to form a hydronium ion and a hydroxide ion\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"90\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#c0305a\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">H₂O</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"90\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#c0305a\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">H₂O</text><path d=\"M230 85 h60 M230 98 h60\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"90\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#c0305a\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"56\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"382\" cy=\"56\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"126\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">H₃O⁺</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">+</text><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#c0305a\" stroke=\"#733\"/><circle cx=\"468\" cy=\"62\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#7ec8e8\" stroke=\"#733\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">−</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">OH⁻</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#a02040\">Figure 8.2 Self-Ionization of Water</text></svg>", "caption": "Figure 8.2 Self-Ionization of Water", "captionUrdu": "شکل 8.2 پانی کی خود آئنائزیشن", "captionPashto": "شکل 8.2 د اوبو ځان آیونایزیشن", "labels": [{"en": "H₂O", "ur": "H₂O", "ps": "H₂O"}, {"en": "H₃O⁺", "ur": "H₃O⁺", "ps": "H₃O⁺"}, {"en": "OH⁻", "ur": "OH⁻", "ps": "OH⁻"}], "sourceGap": {"note": "Space-filling molecular models redrawn as simple circles; sizes and colours approximate."}}], "sourceNote": "Printed folio 244. The right edge is clipped by the page curl on the prose lines and the labels of the first two reactions (\"strong conjugate base\" is cut); clipped endings are marked [scan obscured] and not inferred. The pink italic definition in 8.4.1 is partly faint but the visible words are transcribed. The text refers to \"figure 8.3\" while the printed figure is labelled \"Figure 8.2\" (as printed). A CamScanner watermark crosses the page.", "sourceGap": {"note": "Right-edge clipping; text cites figure 8.3 but the printed figure is 8.2; pink italic definition partly faint."}, "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-12T10:10:37.598541+00:00", "scope": "Chemistry p249", "unresolved": "Edge clipping; figure redrawn on p249; translations need native review"}, "paras": [
chem11Pair("A weak acid has a strong conjugate base and vice versa.","کمزور تیزاب کا مزدوج اساس مضبوط ہوتا ہے اور اس کے برعکس۔","ضعیف اسید قوي مزدوج القلي لري او برعکس.",{"id": "chem11-p249-a1"}),
chem11Pair("A weak base has a strong conjugate acid and vice versa.","کمزور اساس کا مزدوج تیزاب مضبوط ہوتا ہے اور اس کے برعکس۔","ضعیف القلي قوي مزدوج اسید لري او برعکس.",{"id": "chem11-p249-a2"}),
chem11Pair("For example,","مثال کے طور پر،","د بېلګې په توګه،",{"id": "chem11-p249-a3"}),
chem11Pair("Since acetic acid is a weak acid and its conjugate base (CH₃COO⁻) is strong[scan obscured]","چونکہ ایسیٹک ایسڈ کمزور تیزاب ہے اور اس کا مزدوج اساس (CH₃COO⁻) مضبوط ہے [scan obscured]","ځکه چې اسیټیک اسید ضعیف اسید دی او د هغه مزدوج القلي (CH₃COO⁻) قوي دی [scan obscured]",{"id": "chem11-p249-a4"}),
chem11Pair("Similarly, ammonia is a weak base and its conjugate acid (NH₄⁺) is strong acid[scan obscured]","اسی طرح امونیا کمزور اساس ہے اور اس کا مزدوج تیزاب (NH₄⁺) مضبوط تیزاب ہے [scan obscured]","همدارنګه امونیا ضعیف القلي دی او د هغې مزدوج اسید (NH₄⁺) قوي اسید دی [scan obscured]",{"id": "chem11-p249-a5"}),
chem11Pair("8.4.1 Ionization Equation of Water","8.4.1 پانی کی آئنائزیشن مساوات","8.4.1 د اوبو د آیونایزیشن معادله",{"id": "chem11-p249-h841", "kind": "heading"}),
chem11Pair("Water, as you know, is a unique solvent. One of its special properties is its ability to act either as an acid or as a base.","پانی، جیسا کہ آپ جانتے ہیں، ایک منفرد محلل ہے۔ اس کی خاص خصوصیات میں سے ایک یہ ہے کہ یہ تیزاب یا اساس دونوں کی طرح عمل کر سکتا ہے۔","اوبه، لکه څنګه چې تاسو پوهېږئ، یو ځانګړی محلل دی. د هغه یوه ځانګړې ځانګړنه دا ده چې د اسید یا القلي په توګه عمل کولای شي.",{"id": "chem11-p249-b1"}),
chem11Pair("Reading Check","مطالعہ کی جانچ","د لوستلو ازموینه",{"id": "chem11-p249-rc-h", "kind": "heading"}),
chem11Pair("Define strength of acids and bases.","تیزابوں اور اساسوں کی قوت کی تعریف کریں۔","د اسیدونو او القليو قوت تعریف کړئ.",{"id": "chem11-p249-rc1", "role": "question"}),
chem11Pair("Careful electrical-conductivity experiments have shown that pure water is an extremely weak electrolyte. Water undergoes self-[scan obscured] ionization to a small extent, as shown in the model in figure 8.3.","برقی ایصالیت کے محتاط تجربات سے ظاہر ہوا ہے کہ خالص پانی انتہائی کمزور برق پاش ہے۔ پانی خود [scan obscured] آئنائزیشن سے تھوڑی حد تک گزرتا ہے، جیسا کہ شکل 8.3 کے ماڈل میں دکھایا گیا ہے۔","د برېښنايي تېروتنې دقیقو تجربو ښودلې چې خالصې اوبه ډېر ضعیف الکترولایټ دي. اوبه ځان [scan obscured] آیونایزیشن ته په لږه اندازه تېرېږي، لکه څنګه چې په 8.3 شکل کې په ماډل کې ښودل شوي.",{"id": "chem11-p249-b2"}),
chem11Pair("In the self-ionization of water, two water molecules produce a hydroni[scan obscured] ion and a hydroxide ion by transfer of a proton. This reaction is sometimes also[scan obscured] called the autoionization of water.","پانی کی خود آئنائزیشن میں دو پانی کے سالمے پروٹان کی منتقلی سے ایک ہائیڈرونیم [scan obscured] آئن اور ایک ہائیڈرو آکسائیڈ آئن پیدا کرتے ہیں۔ اس تعامل کو بعض اوقات پانی کی ازخود آئنائزیشن بھی کہا جاتا ہے [scan obscured]۔","د اوبو په ځان آیونایزیشن کې دوه د اوبو مالیکولونه د پروټون د لېږد په واسطه یو هایدرونیم [scan obscured] آیون او یو هایدروکسایډ آیون جوړوي. دا تعامل ځینې وختونه د اوبو اتو آیونایزیشن هم بلل کېږي [scan obscured].",{"id": "chem11-p249-b3"}),
chem11Pair("To describe the acid, base properties of water in the Bronsted - Lowery[scan obscured] framework, you express its autoionization as follows.","برونسٹڈ لوری [scan obscured] ڈھانچے میں پانی کی تیزابی اساسی خصوصیات بیان کرنے کے لیے آپ اس کی ازخود آئنائزیشن اس طرح لکھتے ہیں۔","د برونسټډ-لوري [scan obscured] چوکاټ کې د اوبو د اسیدي القلي ځانګړنو د بیانولو لپاره تاسو د هغه اتو آیونایزیشن په لاندې ډول لیکئ.",{"id": "chem11-p249-b4"}),
chem11Pair("You can observe the small amount to which the self-ionization of water[scan obscured] occurs by noting the small value of its equilibrium constant K_c. Because you can[scan obscured] use H⁺(aq) and H₃O⁺(aq) interchangeably to represent the hydrated proton, the[scan obscured] equilibrium constant can also be expressed more simply as,","آپ پانی کی خود آئنائزیشن کی چھوٹی مقدار کا اندازہ اس کے توازنی مستقلہ K_c کی چھوٹی قیمت سے لگا سکتے ہیں [scan obscured]۔ چونکہ آپ آبیدہ پروٹان کو ظاہر کرنے کے لیے H⁺(aq) اور H₃O⁺(aq) کو ایک دوسرے کی جگہ استعمال کر سکتے ہیں [scan obscured]، توازنی مستقلہ زیادہ سادگی سے یوں بھی ظاہر کیا جا سکتا ہے،","تاسو کولای شئ د اوبو د ځان آیونایزیشن لږ مقدار د هغه د تعادل ثابت K_c د کوچني ارزښت په کتلو سره وګورئ [scan obscured]. ځکه چې تاسو کولای شئ H⁺(aq) او H₃O⁺(aq) د هایدریټ شوي پروټون د ښودلو لپاره یو د بل پر ځای وکاروئ [scan obscured]، د تعادل ثابت په ډېره ساده توګه هم ښودل کېدای شي،",{"id": "chem11-p249-b5"})
]});
chem11WordVocabulary["electrolyte"]={"ur": "برق پاش", "ps": "الکترولایټ"};
